<title>POLAND: KPW clears Handlowy bonds for trade.</title>
<headline>KPW clears Handlowy bonds for trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) approved on Thursday for public trade 28 million convertible bonds and 28 million new shares of the B series of Bank Handlowy SA, the KPW said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the bonds included 5,446,000 million convertible bonds for Handlowy's stable investors including JP Morgan International, Zurich Insurance Company and Swedbank.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
